  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Phase-out of MB in Horticulture and Commodities Fumigation Except in Date Use - Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The implementation of the national phase-out plan for MB in horticulture and commodities fumigation except in date use will achieve the complete phase-out of 184.2 ODP tonnes, representing the remaining controlled uses of MB in Egypt. The phase-out of MB will be achieved through the full implementation of all the technologies that have been introduced during the previous MB phase-out project.</narrative>
  </description>
